          "heading": "Kepu Tuipulotu a doubt for England's autumn Tests with knee injury",
          "body": "Hooker Kepu Tuipulotu has emerged as a doubt for England's Nations Championship campaign after picking up a knee injury in national training on Tuesday. The uncapped 21-year-old had been tipped to make his England breakthrough this autumn, and it is understood he will not be in the squad for the opener with Australia, with the timeframe for his return unclear. Fin Smith is a major doubt for the Wallabies fixture. He joined Bath's academy in 2024 and signed a contract to 2028 earlier this year."
