          "heading": "Shaun Edwards joins Argentina's Pumas, reportedly ruling out Borthwick role",
          "body": "Defence coach Shaun Edwards has joined Argentina's Pumas for a Rugby World Cup push in Australia, a move AP reported on 23 October. Coverage says the switch rules out any role in Steve Borthwick's England set-up, closing off the route reported earlier this month. The Daily Mail's view was that Steve Borthwick and the RFU had missed a golden opportunity."
