          "heading": "Joey Carbery impresses as Leinster rout Connacht 50-5 in URC",
          "body": "Joey Carbery kicked from the tee and in open play, scored a try and converted it from the touchline, and Planet Rugby called him the visitors' 'biggest attacking weapon' as Leinster beat Connacht 50-5 in the URC on Friday evening. Tries from Gus McCarthy, Jordan Larmour and Todd Lawlor had Leinster well clear inside the first half-hour, and Dave Heffernan supplied Connacht's only response. Planet Rugby also credited a 'ferocious' Leinster defence that left the hosts with little cohesive attack."
