          "heading": "Italy U18 technical director Alessandro Lodi names side for Ireland test",
          "body": "Italy Under 18 head to Badia Polesine on Saturday for a test against Ireland's Under 18s, and technical director Alessandro Lodi has named his side. The match comes a year after Italy beat Ireland 54-14 in Cosenza, and Lodi says he expects an intense game with high tempo and heavy pressure. He wants his players to show courage and personality, and to keep their own style of play."
