          "heading": "Duhan van der Merwe released from Scotland squad to play for Edinburgh",
          "body": "Duhan van der Merwe has been released from Scotland's squad to return to Edinburgh for Saturday's URC match against Benetton, with Gregor Townsend wanting the winger to build match fitness. It is not a punishment, the Scotland boss stressing it is not a sign the winger has fallen out of favour. Van der Merwe has played just 18 minutes this season, his comeback against the Lions cut short by a dislocated finger. Townsend said: \"It was a much better outcome than it looked at the time.\""
