          "heading": "Wales release Josh Adams to play for Cardiff against Ospreys",
          "body": "Wales have released wing Josh Adams to play for Cardiff in Saturday's Welsh derby against the Ospreys, giving the 31-year-old more game time. He has played only twice this season, returning earlier this month off the bench against Northampton Saints. Last year he was a regular for Wales, starting two autumn Tests and every Six Nations match, plus two summer games. Cardiff, beaten at the Arms Park by the Sharks last Friday, will be looking to bounce back."
