          "body": "Felipe Contepomi has finalised his first Nations Championship squad, and the headline call is the return of veteran Facundo Isa, who replaces the injured Santiago Grondona. Isa's last Argentina appearance came in July 2025, and he missed out on international duty in 2024 and 2026. The 33-man group travels to Dublin for the opener against Ireland, while Franco Molina, a mainstay in Contepomi selections, misses out and Tomás Lavanini returns in the second row."
