          "body": "Patrick Tuipulotu and Sam Darry are both left out of the 36-man squad for the November tour to Scotland, Wales and England, with Jamie Hannah picked ahead of them. Darry started two Tests in Rugby's Greatest Rivalry and had a strong Nations Championship, yet has drifted down the second-row pecking order. Stephen Donald said Dave Rennie has quickly built depth, adding that Darry is unlucky and that some players now genuinely miss out. Du'Plessis Kirifi and Kyren Taumoefolau also miss out."
